      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> ベクトルの内積",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> ベクトルの内積",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gC-1s29ThoJueg_Q3_fEN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4540.255980644379,
      "y": -1873.7048693371403,
      "width": 564.5639038085938,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bYJAS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 875954570,
      "version": 1291,
      "versionNonce": 1041855027,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795180606020,
      "created": 1789470104712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Vector A = {a1, a2, a3...an}\nVactor B = {b1, b2, b3...bn}  があるとする\nその時, A・B を内積といい, 以下で計算する",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Vector A = {a1, a2, a3...an}\nVactor B = {b1, b2, b3...bn}  があるとする\nその時, A・B を内積といい, 以下で計算する",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9mdEGVH4OTO6P-YMM8x22",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4543.716895738263,
      "y": -1748.4080202187683,
      "width": 544.935791015625,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bYJAV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2110865482,
      "version": 1185,
      "versionNonce": 1611939453,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795180606020,
      "created": 1789470186061,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A・B = (a1*b1) + (a2*b2) + ... + (an*bn)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A・B = (a1*b1) + (a2*b2) + ... + (an*bn)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "EA8q9dm2lniq6xvLVtjs2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4493.150684563112,
      "y": -1648.7074992384255,
      "width": 537.7119140625,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bYJAZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1461102346,
      "version": 1454,
      "versionNonce": 154317779,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795180606020,
      "created": 1789470569700,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> バックプロパゲーション(誤差逆伝播法)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> バックプロパゲーション(誤差逆伝播法)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Tc-zoIlPTcPeWmLmHWqnw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4552.250019256303,
      "y": -1453.835550385193,
      "width": 1009.06396484375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bYJAd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 411121098,
      "version": 1504,
      "versionNonce": 1600218845,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795180606020,
      "created": 1789470623424,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 誤差の計算: 予測と正しい答えのズレ（誤差）を求める\n2. 逆向きの伝播: 出力層から入力層に向かって、誤差の情報を後ろ向きに伝える\n3. 影響度の分析: 重みやバイアスがどれだけ誤差に関係しているかを計算する\n4. 調整: 誤差が小さくなるようにパラメータの値を少しずつ書き換える",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 誤差の計算: 予測と正しい答えのズレ（誤差）を求める\n2. 逆向きの伝播: 出力層から入力層に向かって、誤差の情報を後ろ向きに伝える\n3. 影響度の分析: 重みやバイアスがどれだけ誤差に関係しているかを計算する\n4. 調整: 誤差が小さくなるようにパラメータの値を少しずつ書き換える",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gh2FXgggoCX5Q72xUKDqK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4548.616879593071,
      "y": -1605.5321473248664,
      "width": 784,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bYJAh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1395387530,
      "version": 1197,
      "versionNonce": 1324532083,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795180606020,
      "created": 1789470716899,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "教師あり学習を通して, NNをトレーニングし, \nより精度の高い予測を可能にするための機械学習アルゴリズム",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "教師あり学習を通して, NNをトレーニングし, \nより精度の高い予測を可能にするための機械学習アルゴリズム",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
